{"4051140": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "88 NIGHTS IN THE FOREST", "steam_appid": 4051140, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🔥 Survive 88 Nights</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your campfire is the only source of light and safety. Upgrade it, expand its glow, and turn your base into a fortress.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4051140/extras/46219ef6f35c5e1c61f4674b18c5d5fd.poster.avif?t=1761252490\" width=320 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4051140/extras/46219ef6f35c5e1c61f4674b18c5d5fd.webm?t=1761252490\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4051140/extras/46219ef6f35c5e1c61f4674b18c5d5fd.mp4?t=1761252490\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🛠 Base &amp; Building</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build walls, traps, and structures. Every upgrade matters when the forest grows darker and enemies stronger.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4051140/extras/946369ccb82218b6ee3188c833759abd.poster.avif?t=1761252490\" width=320 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4051140/extras/946369ccb82218b6ee3188c833759abd.webm?t=1761252490\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4051140/extras/946369ccb82218b6ee3188c833759abd.mp4?t=1761252490\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🌲 Expeditions</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Venture into the forest to gather resources and rare materials. The further you go, the greater the risks — and the rewards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4051140/extras/8ace159e5df69f5f97ce745a138aa919.poster.avif?t=1761252490\" width=320 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4051140/extras/8ace159e5df69f5f97ce745a138aa919.webm?t=1761252490\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4051140/extras/8ace159e5df69f5f97ce745a138aa919.mp4?t=1761252490\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >👹 Enemies</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face twisted zombie-animals drawn to the warmth of your fire. Each night, new horrors close in on your camp.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4051140/extras/c313a47310d7e4a0b9bf6604430abf73.poster.avif?t=1761252490\" width=320 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4051140/extras/c313a47310d7e4a0b9bf6604430abf73.webm?t=1761252490\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🎯 The Challenge</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >88 nights. No second chances. Endure the darkness, protect your light, and prove you can survive the forest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4051140/extras/51cbb2aa9e9409a742e003e0d4b77457.poster.avif?t=1761252490\" width=320 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4051140/extras/51cbb2aa9e9409a742e003e0d4b77457.webm?t=1761252490\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🔥 Survive 88 Nights</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your campfire is the only source of light and safety. Upgrade it, expand its glow, and turn your base into a fortress.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4051140/extras/46219ef6f35c5e1c61f4674b18c5d5fd.poster.avif?t=1761252490\" width=320 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4051140/extras/46219ef6f35c5e1c61f4674b18c5d5fd.webm?t=1761252490\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4051140/extras/46219ef6f35c5e1c61f4674b18c5d5fd.mp4?t=1761252490\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🛠 Base &amp; Building</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build walls, traps, and structures. Every upgrade matters when the forest grows darker and enemies stronger.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4051140/extras/946369ccb82218b6ee3188c833759abd.poster.avif?t=1761252490\" width=320 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4051140/extras/946369ccb82218b6ee3188c833759abd.webm?t=1761252490\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4051140/extras/946369ccb82218b6ee3188c833759abd.mp4?t=1761252490\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🌲 Expeditions</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Venture into the forest to gather resources and rare materials. The further you go, the greater the risks — and the rewards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4051140/extras/8ace159e5df69f5f97ce745a138aa919.poster.avif?t=1761252490\" width=320 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4051140/extras/8ace159e5df69f5f97ce745a138aa919.webm?t=1761252490\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4051140/extras/8ace159e5df69f5f97ce745a138aa919.mp4?t=1761252490\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >👹 Enemies</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face twisted zombie-animals drawn to the warmth of your fire. Each night, new horrors close in on your camp.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4051140/extras/c313a47310d7e4a0b9bf6604430abf73.poster.avif?t=1761252490\" width=320 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4051140/extras/c313a47310d7e4a0b9bf6604430abf73.webm?t=1761252490\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🎯 The Challenge</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >88 nights. No second chances. Endure the darkness, protect your light, and prove you can survive the forest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4051140/extras/51cbb2aa9e9409a742e003e0d4b77457.poster.avif?t=1761252490\" width=320 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4051140/extras/51cbb2aa9e9409a742e003e0d4b77457.webm?t=1761252490\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p>", "short_description": "88 Nights in the Forest is an atmospheric survival horror. Build and fortify your b